  "description": "Design pedagogy for optocoupler and optoisolator circuits — galvanic isolation via LED-photodetector pairs, current transfer ratio (CTR) design, digital isolation, solid-state relays (optotriac + triac), linear/analog isolation amplifiers, IR transmit/receive links, and fiber-optic data links. Teaches how to transfer signals across isolation barriers from first principles.",
